# Daily Maverick

> Daily Maverick is a leading South African independent news publication. Pages are available as Markdown by appending `.md` to the URL (for example `/article/<slug>.md`, `/video/<slug>.md`, `/cartoon/<slug>.md`, `/crossword/<slug>.md`).

## Primary sections

- [Business Maverick](https://www.dailymaverick.co.za/business-maverick/): Business, economics and markets
- [Maverick Life](https://www.dailymaverick.co.za/maverick-life/): Arts, culture and lifestyle
- [Maverick Citizen](https://www.dailymaverick.co.za/maverick-citizen/): Social justice and human rights
- [Our Burning Planet](https://www.dailymaverick.co.za/maverick-earth/): Climate and environment
- [Corruption, Inc.](https://www.dailymaverick.co.za/corruption-watch/): Investigations into corruption
- [Opinionista](https://www.dailymaverick.co.za/opinionistas/): Opinion and analysis
- [Videos](https://www.dailymaverick.co.za/videos/): Video journalism
- [Cartoons](https://www.dailymaverick.co.za/cartoons/): Editorial cartoons
- [Crosswords](https://www.dailymaverick.co.za/crosswords/): Daily puzzles

